					<LocaText>
						<English>
							<Text>&lt;b&gt;The Sultan speaks of a vision for the future,&lt;/b&gt; of opening his realm to the world and embracing progress. He tells you of &lt;b&gt;Wadi Al Zahir&lt;/b&gt;, a remote desert region at the borders of his domain. There, nomadic tribes dwell, and he wishes for a new settlement to foster exchange between his people and the industrial powers of the west.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In return, you are granted exclusive rights to develop the region, to gather its resources, and to share in its prosperity. Madame Kahina, ever resourceful, is awarded an island to serve as a trading outpost to support your endeavors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;With a final gesture, the Sultan presents you with a map and his blessing.&lt;/b&gt; Your next destination is clear: Wadi Al Zahir.</Text>
